& [HardConstraints]
  + C1 preserve exact raw source sourcebookend A5 and preparation-plan anchors; no upstream mutation
  + C2 all A5 evidence is replayed; full nested receipt cannot be replaced by trusted summary
  + C3 exact inherited-plan digest roles operations and request match the proposal already verified under the unchanged legacy signature
  + C4 separate historical commit pins from explicitly supplied expected/observed carrier and old capacity from new supplied capacity
  + C5 only descriptor six changes; raw identity before typed bundle admission
  + C6 exact ordered observation coordinates; valid adverse states distinct from malformed structure
  + C7 ten comparisons determine unique ordered mismatch account and matched/mismatched status
  + C8 preserve nested33 and global14 false authority fields; every global and nested effect account stays zero
  + C9 fixed strict bounds canonical forms twenty-six evidence files and twenty-four explicit inputs; no growth by silently raising bounds
  + C10 stable explicit files only; no atomic snapshot or protection against arbitrary concurrent ancestor replacement
  + C11 one attempt zero retries zero cleanup no host observation no resolver no signer no process or writer in product core
  + C12 exact debug overflow release documentation Clippy format dual-host script/evidence gates attribution and non-force publication
& [Outside]
  + supplied strings and digests do not establish collector identity truth currentness revocation time consent ownership or safe execution
  + user process-only RemoteSigned approval is limited to reviewed development scripts and changes no persistent policy
